                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Lost with Dinosaurs, another platformer game with the setting in the jungle where dinosaurs are the main obstacle.\n\n+Good graphic for a platformer game.\n+Perfect game (300 Steam Achievements) in less than 30 minutes. If you're not willing to beat the game, just play in level 1 or 2 and collect the mushrooms over and over.\n\n-Still have a bug, especially in character movements.\n-This game could be better than current version. Level design really need improvements.\n\nAlmost recommended, but unfortunately no: 5/10",
